	(text "Haptics sheet (step 5): DRV2605L VSSOP-10 (DRV2605LDGS) on VSYS.\n- 1 uF on VDD and on REG. EN <- HAPT_EN, IN/TRIG <- HAPT_TRIG.\n- I2C at 1.8 V (VIH 1.3 V), address 0x5A. Keep VDD powered (an unpowered driver clamps the bus).\n- OUT+/OUT- to two LRA lead pads beside the stiffened 9 mm LRA tape-down pad.\n- Firmware blocks the motor while docked (VSYS can reach 5.5 V)."
